{"type":"text","timestamp":1768790953679,"sessionID":"ses_42bde3593ffewMjoFeBKVAd3J5","part":{"id":"prt_bd427f2e1001XDzL7ISKNB5lIK","sessionID":"ses_42bde3593ffewMjoFeBKVAd3J5","messageID":"msg_bd427e3b60019J8ZSCo87uwlmg","type":"text","text":"The YouTube Player Component has been implemented successfully. The commit was created locally but cannot be pushed because the remote repository `smaluk/chronotunes` doesn't exist on GitHub.\n\n**Summary of what was implemented:**\n\n1. **Created `src/components/player/YouTubePlayer.tsx`** with:\n   - YouTube IFrame API loading\n   - Video player with minimal/hidden UI (1x1 pixel, positioned off-screen)\n   - Play/pause controls via button\n   - Error handling for unavailable videos\n   - Status indicators (Loading, Playing, Paused)\n\n2. **Created `src/components/player/YouTubePlayer.test.tsx`** with 10 tests covering:\n   - Play button rendering\n   - Loading state display\n   - Error state display (empty/undefined video ID)\n   - Button disabled state\n   - Custom className application\n   - Hidden YouTube container\n   - Play icon rendering\n   - Error state styling and icons\n\n3. **All YouTubePlayer tests pass** (10/10)\n\n4. **Biome lint passes** with no issues\n\nThe component fulfills all acceptance criteria:\n- ✅ Load YouTube IFrame API\n- ✅ Play video by youtubeVideoId from round track\n- ✅ Hide video element (audio only/minimal UI)\n- ✅ Handle video unavailable errors\n- ✅ Add play/pause controls\n- ✅ Video loads and plays audio\n- ✅ Video is hidden or minimal\n- ✅ Error handling for unavailable videos\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>","time":{"start":1768790953679,"end":1768790953679}}}
